          ForgeRestore forgeScreen, forgeCalc, forgeEvents
          Exit Function
ErrHandler:
          ForgeLog "BuildShortageList", Err.Number, Err.Description, Erl
          BuildShortageList = -2
          Resume CleanExit
End Function

